{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool aggregation with transformer aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup using pca_n2000 RNA and resnet50 image encoders. Validation accuracy of 0.5793 (vs 0.6186 in llm_summary_004) and F1 of 0.5631 suggest transformer aggregation may not improve performance compared to avgpool in this configuration. The relative impact of aggregation methods and their interaction with fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparisons to other aggregation approaches."
}

